{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05295","headline":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制 · 杨廉","name":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万乘临真境，重阳眺远空。\n慈云浮鴈塔，定水映龙宫。\n宝铎含飙响，仙轮带日红。\n天文将瑞色，辉焕满寰中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨廉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05295.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05295","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《御选唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/御選唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}